  unitName: Polevik
  unitId: 30051
  unitNumber: 72
  description: A human-like plant native to deep, sunless forests. Since they perform
    photosynthesis like other plants, they don't harm or interact with humans unless
    necessary. However, when poor care is given to plants or forests, they attack
    with a war cry. They don't hate people, however, and have been found smiling
    near well-kept gardens and farms.
  summonDesc: I don't have allies.<br>But you may be an exception.<br>I'm counting
    on you.
  fusionDesc: I can't decide whether to be<br>a bonsai or a flower arrangement.
  evoDesc: Grr!! I've had a good life,<br>so maybe I should stop <br>with the shouting.
